 he looked  exhausted but it's still very impressive  nonetheless considering how good of a  fighter marco is in battle it's all the  more impressive that he can be just as  helpful when it comes to healing others  we've seen him use his flames to help  heal others and more specifically he's  used them as a way to help prevent the  further spread of queen's virus in many  people notably marco's flames won't burn  you as they burn unlike conventional  flames but they can definitely be used  to reinforce the power of his attacks so  the op power comes with both offensive  defensive and healing capabilities  notably oda has told us that marco's  healing has limitations in a question  corner so he's not necessarily immortal  in his phoenix form it's quite likely  that if marco drains all his stamina he  won't be able to use the healing powers  which might explain why he sometimes  leaves minor wounds like scratches or  bruises unhealed in battle another way  marco could definitely be defeated is if  you expose him to seastone then he won't  be able to use his regeneration on  lethal wounds it should be said that  marco's forces fought against  blackbeard's forces in the payback war  about a year after the paramount war and  marco's side was obliterated even so  marco made it out fine without suffering  lasting wounds thanks to his phoenix  powers but i think that's enough about  marco for the purposes of this video his  mythical fruit is one of my favorites  and though it does have its limits which  makes sense it has let marco at the very  least exchange blows with many of the  best fighters in the world without  taking any lasting damage next up we  have kaido himself the leader of the  beast pirates and the man called the  strongest creature in the world kaido's  bounty is over 4.6 billion berries  meaning among the living yonko he has  the highest bounty so the question was  for a long time what exact devil fruit  did kaido have what mythical zone is  worthy of goin