l zone  fruit namely the hitohito no me model  daibutsu or the human human fruit model  buddha he has the ability to transform  into a giant gold buddha during chapter  578 at marine ford we see his giant form  launch shock waves at blackbeard  blackbeard and his crew are shown to be  rattled by the attack whited out eyes  blood and all that jazz but obviously  the attack doesn't keep blackbeard down  obviously sengoku's size and physical  power in this form are great and  although he failed to execute ace with a  punch thanks to luffy's inflated stomach  and a candle wall his power still led to  the execution platform collapsing and  that is it for sengoku we haven't seen  much of his power in action but what we  have seen was no doubt epic definitely a  power fitting for a former fleet admiral  next up we have yamato kaido's child and  number one odin fan as us weekly manga  readers found out recently yamato also  has a mythical zone fruit namely the  inuinu no me model okuchi no makami or  the dog dog fruit model okuchino makami  we're told it is a rare mythical wolf  and that it is a guardian spirit of wano  and that makes it all the more painful  for kaido that yamato is using it and  claiming to be odin the fruit lets  yamato turn into a wolf god pretty much  and we've seen the cool looking hybrid  form clash with kaido's own hybrid form  not only is it clearly mythical and  powerful it's also very valuable because  of its symbolic value for wano  specifically it'll obviously be easier  to rule a country if their guardian  deity is supporting you rather than  challenging your authority another hype  fact is that kaido says he worked hard  to acquire that devil fruit and whenever  yonko worked hard to acquire specific  fruit like black bear with the dark dark  fruit and shanks with the gomu gomu no  me it's always a sign that the fruit is  an especially big deal keep in mind this  is not just a mythical zone but a  carnivorous mythical zone making the  fruit es