lity of his mythical scales has  also been noted multiple times during  chapter 923 luffy hit kaido many times  with haki enhanced attacks and although  they landed and looked painful kaido got  up unscathed like absolutely nothing  happened and went on to take out luffy  with one quick blow it's also been said  about kaido's fruit that it gives kaido  access to more supernatural abilities  than any other mythical zone we've seen  so far one such ability is that he can  create flame clouds that for all intents  and purposes allow him to fly and can  even lift up an entire island and turn  it into a flying castle additionally  kaido has been seen launching  devastating fire blasts from his mouth  in dragon mode and hybrid mode and the  list goes on this truly godlike creature  has turned his roar into lightning he  has released blades of wind strong  enough to cut off a red scabbard's arm  and he's been able to summon multiple  tornadoes which led to zorro labeling  him a natural disaster it seems like in  close combat kaido's hybrid form is the  most powerful since he saves that form  for last he's not unheard-able because  attacks that can bypass his tough scales  can cause harm like advanced hockey  infused attacks and opeope no me  surgical techniques and so on after all  odin did succeed in leaving a huge  lasting scar on him still there's no  doubt that this is one of the best devil  fruits of all and arguably the strongest  mythical zone fruit there is it even  makes the sea a usual devil fruit  weakness a non-issue because the dragon  form can just fly over it i think that's  enough kaido for this video because we  do have others to cover but let's just  say this fruit did not disappoint in the  least next let's look at sengoku the  former fleet admiral and living legend  he was one of the major figures back  during goldie rogers time along with  whitebeard shiki and garp after the time  skip this dude is 79 years old he has an  especially interesting mythical zone  fruit namely the hitohito no me model  daibutsu or the human human fruit model  buddha he has the ability to transform  into a giant gold buddha during chapter  578 at marine ford we see his giant form  launch shock waves at blackbeard  blackbeard and his crew are shown to be  rattled by the attack whited out eyes  blood and all that jazz but obviously  the attack doesn't keep blackbeard down  obviously sengoku's size and physical  power in this form are great and  although he failed to execute ace with a  punch thanks to luffy's inflated stomach  and a candle wall his power still led to  the execution platform collapsing and  that is it for sengoku we haven't seen  much of his power in action but what we  have seen was no doubt epic definitely a  power fitting for a former fleet admiral  next up we have yamato kaido's child and  number one odin fan as us weekly manga  readers found out recently yamato also  has a mythical zone fruit namely the  inuinu no me model okuchi no makami or  the dog dog fruit model okuchino makami  we're told it is a rare mythical wolf  and that it is a guardian spirit of wano  and that makes it all the more painful  for kaido that yamato is using it and  claiming to be odin the fruit lets  yamato turn into a wolf god pretty much  and we've seen the cool looking hybrid  form clash with kaido's own hybrid form  not only is it clearly mythical and  powerful it's also very valuable because  of its symbolic value for wano  specifically it'll obviously be easier  to rule a country if their guardian  deity is supporting you rather than  challenging your authority another hype  fact is that kaido says he worked hard  to acquire that devil fruit and whenever  yonko worked hard to acquire specific  fruit like black bear with the dark dark  fruit and shanks with the gomu gomu no  me it's always a sign that the fruit is  an especially big deal keep in mind this  is not just a mythical zone but a  carnivorous mythical zone making the  fruit especially well suited for combat  and it would have to be special to allow  one to repeatedly clash with the  so-called world's strongest creature in  his op hybrid form we saw how quickly  kaido took out luffy the first time so  the fact that yamato can occupy the anko  for so long while he's in his strongest  form is no small feat we've also seen  yamato fire a mouth blast called namuji  glacier fang at kaido and that was met  with one of his own blast breaths and  the attacks canceled each other out it's  an interesting attack name that lends a  fire versus ice dynamic to the kaido vs  yamato fight yamato's mythical fruit did  not disappoint and as i've said many  times i would love to have a mythical  zone user like yamato join the straw hat  crew my only concern is that it wouldn't  make much sense symbolically for the  guardian deity of wano to leave the  island but we'll see what happens so  those are all the canon fruits and i  could stop the video right here but for  those who perfectly remember all the  details about all the mythical zone  users and additionally remember  everything they've read about them in  otis question corners i do have some  bonus mythical zone fruits for you so  even you the most hardcore fans just  might learn something new about one  piece in this video let's start the  non-canon fruits off with the bato bato  no me model vampire aka the bat bat  fruit model vampire this fruit gives its  user patrick redfield the ability to  turn into a you guessed it vampire this  character was designed by oda himself  and serves as the main antagonist of the  one piece unlimited world red game again  this is non-canon but according to  sengoku redfield was powerful enough to  rival the pirate king in his prime a  very hype statement with his unique  mythical zone powers redfield can  sharpen his teeth and use them to you  guessed it suck the blood out of his  enemies they age quickly as a result  while he becomes stronger and through  these means gains access to eternal  youth next up we have the toritorinomi  model nue aka the bird bird fruit model  nue this fruit was featured in the one  piece art nue a series of artwork  created for the one piece x kyoto event  in 2017 that depicts a non-canon story  of the straw hats in wano the fruit was  eaten by toratsugu a resident of wano  which is fitting because the nue is a  mythical japanese yokai it's a  chemerical beast that borrows different  body parts from different animals for  instance it has the face of a monkey the  body of a tiger the mane of a lion and a  snake for a tail when toratsugu  transforms into the yokai he has the  ability to fly but is nevertheless  overpowered relatively quickly by luffy  oda himself drew the climactic scene  where luffy battles the nue for the  final mythical zone user we turn to a  video game again specifically to one  piece unlimited world red again in this  video game we also find out about inui  no no model baked danuki literally  translated to dog dog fruit model  monster raccoon dog it allows its user  to transform into a tanuki monster and  it was eaten by get this a pen once  again oda designed the mythical zone pen  called pato and pato belongs to the  already mentioned patrick redfield potto  may not be the most op mythical zone  user but he's definitely interesting he  can use the tip of his tail to write and  furthermore has the ability to transform  leaves into objects and people by riding  on them and that is it all nine mythical  zone users from one piece video games  and art exhibitions included and their  powers explained thank you so much for  staying tuned until the end and let me  know which mythical zone you'd want it  could be from this list or you could  pick from a myth that we haven't seen  yet in one piece if you did enjoy this  video and want to keep them coming the  best thing you could do is channel the  pirate king within and smash that like  button with no mercy if you haven't make  this the video you subscribe and hit  that notification bell to turn on all  notifications or you will miss future  one-piece videos and while you wait for  the next video to drop feel free to  check out my growing one-piece playlist  that includes videos on all the fruits  yonko warlords and much much more link  to that is in the description and if you  don't see a video you'd really like me  to cover in the playlist then suggest it  in the comments and until next time see  ya space cowboys  [Music]  my
 

